# WTR-LAB.COM — OAuth & Auth Surface Addendum

**Target:** `wtr-lab.com` (production, owned / consented)
**Tanggal:** 2026-08-23
**Auth library:** Better Auth (Next.js v15)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

WTR-LAB pakai **Better Auth** untuk auth, dengan konfigurasi:
- Email/password: **DISABLED** (`EMAIL_PASSWORD_DISABLED`, `EMAIL_PASSWORD_SIGN_UP_DISABLED`)
- Magic link (email-based): **BROKEN — return HTTP 500** (SMTP/ProtonMail misconfigured)
- Social: Google, Discord, Patreon, GitHub aktif

Assessment menemukan **8 endpoint auth yang aktif** dan beberapa info leak / misconfiguration.

---

