## 3. OAuth Client Configuration (Recon)

`POST /api/auth/sign-in/social` return OAuth init URL dengan `client_id` (public half). 4 provider aktif:

| Provider | `client_id` | `scope` | Callback path |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Google | `365166915661-imf3vlkl3creps2lo3tmc9ri48regmmi.apps.googleusercontent.com` | `email profile openid` + `include_granted_scopes=true` | `/api/auth/callback/google` |
| Discord | `1339189112724394037` | `identify email role_connections.write` (duplicated `identify+email` di scope) | `/api/auth/callback/discord` |
| Patreon | `[REDACTED]-LkzIdFeVDtWgrTlWv` | `identity identity[email] campaigns campaigns.members` | `/api/auth/oauth2/callback/patreon` (beda!) |
| GitHub | `Ov23lirdlCRfNlu76zzU` | `read:user user:email` | `/api/auth/callback/github` |

Provider NOT aktif (return `Provider not found`): `twitter`, `facebook`, `linkedin`, `apple`, `microsoft`, `twitch`.

**Auth flow detail:**
- **State**: random 32-char string, signed & encrypted, disimpan di cookie `__Secure-better-auth.state`
  - `Max-Age=300` (5 min)
  - `HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax`
  - Format: `EoGiK_3EAtzkidTyFx0QjmFh53mqXGJQ.Q9ebuweSDwkezz%2FG0PkOg2v3eEAgiptl0ph9ieTC4jk%3D` (state.signature)
- **PKCE**: aktif untuk Google + GitHub (`code_challenge_method=S256`)
- **CSRF**: state validation enforced (tested: invalid state → `state_mismatch`)
- **HTTP 302** ke `/api/auth/error?error=<code>` saat state invalid

### 3.1 Cookie Attributes (from social init)

```
__Secure-better-auth.state=<state>.<sig>; 
  Max-Age=300; 
  Path=/; 
  HttpOnly; 
  Secure; 
  SameSite=Lax
```

