## 4. Test Results

### 4.1 Magic Link — BROKEN

```bash
$ for i in {1..5}; do
    curl -s -X POST "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/sign-in/magic-link" \
      -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
      -d '{"email":"test@example.com","callbackURL":"/en/profile"}' \
      -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code} time:%{time_total}\n"
  done
500 time:0.531848
500 time:0.483797
500 time:0.558151
500 time:0.595559
500 time:0.501269
```

Email valid → HTTP 500 konsisten. **Tidak bisa daftar via magic link.**

### 4.2 Email/Password — DISABLED

```bash
$ curl -s -X POST "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/sign-in/email" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"email":"test@test.com","password":"password123"}'
{"message":"Email and password is not enabled","code":"EMAIL_PASSWORD_DISABLED"}

$ curl -s -X POST "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/sign-up/email" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"email":"test@test.com","password":"password123","name":"test"}'
{"message":"Email and password sign up is not enabled","code":"[REDACTED]"}
```

### 4.3 Social Login — Init OK

```bash
$ curl -s -X POST "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/sign-in/social" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"provider":"google","callbackURL":"/en"}' | python3 -c "
import json, sys, urllib.parse
d = json.load(sys.stdin)
print('URL:', d['url'][:100])
print('Redirect:', d['redirect'])"
URL: https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth?response_type=code&client_id=365166915661-imf3
Redirect: True
```

### 4.4 Callback — CSRF protected

```bash
$ curl -sI "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/callback/google?code=fake&state=fake" | head -5
HTTP/2 302
location: https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/error?error=state_mismatch
```

### 4.5 Error Page

```bash
$ curl -sI "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/error?error=state_mismatch"
HTTP/2 200
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
```

XSS test:
```bash
$ curl -s "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/error?error=<script>alert(1)</script>" | grep -c "<script>alert"
0  # ← tidak reflected, escaped
```

### 4.6 Rate Limit — OK

```bash
# 20x rapid request ke /api/auth/sign-in/social
  17: 200
  18: 429  ← rate limit aktif
  19: 200 (next minute)
```

