## 5. Findings (Auth-specific)

### F-AUTH-01 [High] — Magic link broken (SMTP misconfigured)

**Deskripsi:** Magic link return HTTP 500 setiap saat. SMTP provider (likely ProtonMail atau service lain) tidak ter-configure dengan benar di Better Auth.

**Dampak:**
- **Lockout potential** — jika OAuth providers down, users tidak bisa login
- **DoS surface** — attacker bisa spam endpoint → server log 500 terus (Sentry noise)
- **Information disclosure** — error 500 di-log ke Sentry → mungkin bocor stack trace / env var

**Reproduksi:**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/sign-in/magic-link" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"any@email.com","callbackURL":"/en"}'
# Response: HTTP 500, no body
```

**Rekomendasi:**
- Perbaiki SMTP config (likely Better Auth `emailAndPassword.sendMagicLink` callback broken)
- Tambah fallback: jika SMTP down, return 503 + generic message
- Set response message generic untuk semua error auth (jangan 500 dengan stack trace bocor)

---

### F-AUTH-02 [Medium] — OAuth scope over-request (Patreon, Discord)

**Confidence:** Confirmed

**Deskripsi:**
- **Patreon scope** minta `identity identity[email] campaigns campaigns.members` — `campaigns.members` allow baca list patron dan tier mereka. Untuk sign-in saja, cukup `identity identity.memberships` (atau `identity.members` saja).
- **Discord scope** minta `role_connections.write` — ini allow write role user di server Discord. Untuk sign-in saja, cukup `identify email`.
- Discord scope punya duplikat: `identify email identify email role_connections.write` (ada pengulangan)

**Bukti:** See Section 3.

**Dampak:**
- Jika user link akun via Patreon, attacker (jika ada token leak) bisa baca semua patron + tier
- Jika user link akun via Discord, attacker bisa write role tanpa consent eksplisit

**Rekomendasi:**
- Patreon: ganti scope jadi `identity identity[email].memberships` (atau `identity.memberships`)
- Discord: hapus `role_connections.write` (atau pisah jadi "Link Discord" button terpisah dengan scope berbeda)
- Fix duplikat `identify email` di Discord scope

---

### F-AUTH-03 [Medium] — Two callback URL patterns (Patreon vs others)

**Confidence:** Confirmed

**Deskripsi:**
- Google/Discord/GitHub callback: `/api/auth/callback/[provider]`
- Patreon callback: `/api/auth/oauth2/callback/patreon` (path beda!)

OAuth redirect_uri di-init:
- Google: `redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fwtr-lab.com%2Fapi%2Fauth%2Fcallback%2Fgoogle`
- Patreon: `redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fwtr-lab.com%2Fapi%2Fauth%2Foauth2%2Fcallback%2Fpatreon`

**Dampak:**
- Confusing / tidak konsisten (security anti-pattern)
- Attack surface extra: ada 2 endpoint yang handle OAuth callback

**Rekomendasi:**
- Samakan semua callback ke `/api/auth/callback/[provider]`
- Test ulang OAuth flow setelah perubahan

---

### F-AUTH-04 [Low] — Better Auth verbose Zod error messages

**Deskripsi:** Better Auth return Zod error bocor schema:

```json
{"message":"[body.email] Invalid input: expected string, received undefined; [body.password] Invalid input: expected string, received undefined","code":"VALIDATION_ERROR"}
```

**Dampak:** Information disclosure (internal field naming, Zod paths).

**Rekomendasi:** Override Better Auth error handler untuk return generic `400 Invalid request` di production.

---

### F-AUTH-05 [Info] — State CSRF + PKCE active (positive)

**Confidence:** Confirmed

**Deskripsi:** OAuth flow pakai:
- State token (random 32-char, signed) — CSRF protected
- PKCE (S256) untuk Google + GitHub — code interception protected
- Cookie: `HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax; Max-Age=300`

**Bukti:** State validation test pass (`state_mismatch` returned for fake state).

**Rekomendasi:**
- Pertimbangkan `SameSite=Strict` untuk cookie state (saat ini `Lax`)
- Tambah `__Host-` prefix untuk cookie (saat ini `__Secure-`)

---

### F-AUTH-06 [Info] — Error page XSS-safe

**Confidence:** Confirmed

**Deskripsi:** `/api/auth/error?error=<script>alert(1)</script>` return HTML yang escape XSS payload. Test:
```bash
$ curl -s "https://wtr-lab.com/api/auth/error?error=<script>alert(1)</script>" | grep "<script>alert"
0  # escaped/sanitized
```

**Rekomendasi:** Keep as-is.

---

## 6. Session/Cookie Detail

- **Session cookie name:** `__Secure-better-auth.session_token` (inferred dari state cookie pattern)
- **State cookie:** `__Secure-better-auth.state` (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, Max-Age=300)
- **CSRF:** State-based, validated per callback
- **Token storage:** Cookie-based (not localStorage — good)

---

## 7. Coverage Gaps

- **Tidak test sign-out flow** (butuh session valid)
- **Tidak test session expiration** (butuh session valid + tunggu expiry)
- **Tidak test social linking** (link Patreon ke existing account, etc.)
- **Tidak test account deletion** (butuh auth)
- **Tidak test email verification** (SMTP broken)

---

## 8. Conclusion

Auth surface WTR-LAB relatif aman (CSRF + PKCE aktif, error page escaped, rate limit aktif), tapi ada 2 masalah utama:

1. **Magic link broken (F-AUTH-01)** — High severity, harus di-fix segera
2. **OAuth scope over-request (F-AUTH-02)** — Medium, perlu review

OAuth config overall sudah cukup baik, dengan pattern Better Auth standard. Yang perlu di-improve adalah consistency (callback URL pattern) dan principle of least privilege (scope).

